title: Party Finances
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and dues_timer <= 0
on-arrival: dues_timer = 4; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs

= Party Finances

A revolutionary party still has to pay for paper, printing presses, offices and train tickets.

- @maintain: Collect the usual dues.
- @raise: Ask the members for more.
- @easy_discard

@maintain
subtitle: [+ dues +] funds gained.
on-arrival: resources += dues

The district treasurers send in what they have.

@raise
subtitle: [+ dues + 1 +] funds gained. Members are poor, and some will drift away.
on-arrival: dues += 1; resources += dues; worker_support -= 2; unity -= 2

The money comes in, with complaints. In a winter of hunger, every pfennig counts.
